OL,3,GNEWSADamon Hill pays tribute as Brands
OL,4,AHatch turns 100
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Formula One world champion Damon
OL,7,FHill has described Brands Hatch as "one
OL,8,Fof the great circuits of all time" as
OL,9,Fthe venue celebrates its centenary.
OL,11,FHill said he had a connection with the
OL,12,Fcircuit stretching back almost his
OL,13,Fentire life. "I probably was a baby
OL,14,Fwhen I first went there," he told BBC
OL,15,FRadio Kent.
OL,17,FThe son of Formula One champion Graham
OL,18,FHill, he recalled his father giving him
OL,19,Fa toy motorbike at the West Kingsdown
OL,20,Ftrack.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
